WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 11 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Congratulations Sylvia, keep it up.

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:09.720
Max out your Beast Mate's affinity and you'll eventually break the aging curse and return to your prime 20 year old body.

3
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:18.520
Just you wait. To get my 20 year old body back, I am going to max out these guys if it's the last thing I do.

4
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:31.060
God it reeks in here! Did that old hag finally die and rot away?

5
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:38.270
Well you've got some nerve rabbit, groping some random woman in broad daylight.

6
00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.870
Your master hasn't even been buried yet.

7
00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:46.070
My dear little sister, it's only been one night and you already don't recognize your own blood?

8
00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:54.120
Sylvia? That's impossible. How the hell did you get so young overnight?

9
00:00:54.120 --> 00:01:10.330
Oh, the White Dragon. I've heard some of them are born with mysterious powers. Looks like he took very good care of you last night.

10
00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:17.500
Let's make a deal Sylvia. Keeping a White Dragon by your side is a total waste.

11
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:26.480
I'll trade you my priceless Tanzorion jewelry set. In exchange, the dragon belongs to me.

12
00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:36.460
You'd be smart to take the deal. Sell that jewelry and you'll never have to worry about food or money for the rest of your life.

13
00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:40.460
I've only known her for a day and you've given her the cold shoulder the whole time.

14
00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:43.460
There's no way she turns down that fortune for you.

15
00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:49.770
You'd end up in Cassie's hands. You'd be wishing for death.

16
00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:53.770
Thank God Sylvia seems to like me. Alistar's probably doomed this time.

17
00:01:53.770 --> 00:02:01.770
Tick tock Sylvia. I've never had a White Dragon before. I can't wait to take him back and have some fun. Stop wasting my time!
